# #188: Jaina (traction 0.18, walk 4.80) shields out of a run, right then left.
# a raises shield the frame it lets go of the stick; b lets go with no input.
# Under shield a brakes by double traction (0.36) above walk speed, then by
# traction (0.18), and stops 5 frames before b's run brake (traction alone).
#! chat -dev quick hero jaina proudmoore
60 a stick 1 0
60 b stick 1 0
90 a stick 0 0
90 a shield 1
90 b stick 0 0
140 a shield 0
160 a stick -1 0
160 b stick -1 0
190 a stick 0 0
190 a shield 1
190 b stick 0 0
240 a shield 0
